  "content": "<p><span>这是ItemPhysic的完整版本。若想在原版服务器上使用，必须在服务器端安装，请使用</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic-lite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysic Lite</a><span>。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要前置模组 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p><p><strong>功能特性</strong></p><ul>\n<li>物品漂浮效果</li>\n<li>仅可燃物会在岩浆/火焰中燃烧</li>\n<li>自定义拾取机制</li>\n<li>自定义投掷机制</li>\n<li>物品点燃效果</li>\n<li>可配置的消失时间</li>\n<li>仙人掌不会摧毁物品</li>\n<li>增强的物品动画</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2076336-itemphysic-1-3-4-more-realtistic-items-stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">历史版本下载</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">正在寻找与好友联机的服务器？我们的赞助商为您提供解决方案：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252flogos%252fdark_text%25401538x500.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用优惠码 **teamcreative** 可享所有游戏服务器首月25%折扣！</p><p><strong>扩展组件</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic-guns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysic Guns</a>： \nItemPhysic（精简版或完整版）的扩展组件，修复TaCZ和Superb Warfare模组中3D枪械掉落时的渲染问题。\n&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
